export anchor DarkSoftUIStyle:
    number: 268
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Dark soft UI
    idea: Every panel, row and button is pressed out of one slate surface with paired light and dark shadows, the selected file sinks in, and text stays crisp with a bright focus ring.
    base: dark
    palette:
        slate: #2b2e35, the one surface for page, cards, rows and style sheet
        highlight: #3a3e48, the light top left shadow
        shade: #1c1e23, the dark bottom right shadow
        well: #262930, status chip fill
        ink: #e7eaf0, text
        muted: #b0b7c3, meta, inactive nav, labels and file icons
        blue: #8fbaff, primary button, current icon, storage ring, upload fill and focus ring
        blueInk: #10213d, text and icons on blue
    type:
        One stack, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial.
        Base 15px. The title is 30px at 650, the details title 18px at
        600, file names 15px at 600, meta 13.5px muted, chips 12.5px at
        600, the storage figure 22px.
    layout:
        Three floating areas inside 28px padding. A 240px raised card
        holds a round B mark with Brightwork Drive, the five places with My
        files pressed in, and a raised 150px dial whose blue ring shows
        64.2 of 100 GB, captioned 64.2 GB of 100 GB used. The middle has the
        breadcrumb, the title and a pressed in pill search, then a raised
        blue Upload pill, a raised New folder pill and a pressed List or
        Grid track with List raised. Each file is its own raised 20px
        tile with a pressed round icon well, the name and chips, the date
        over the person, and the size. The selected tile is pressed in
        with its well raised and blue. A 320px raised details card has a
        pressed preview well, the name, a Starred chip, four raised fact
        tiles and three round raised action buttons labelled Share,
        Download and Get link, Share filled blue. Below 1200px details move
        under the list. Below 760px the card puts the dial beside the nav
        and tiles stack their meta.
    spacing: A 4px base on an 8px rhythm. 28px between cards, 16px between tiles, 22px card padding.
    density: Roomy. Each file is a raised tile with a round well.
    corners: 24px cards, 20px tiles, 22px pill buttons, fields and toggles, round wells and action buttons.
    borders: None. Edges come only from light and shade.
    shadows: Raised is 6px 6px 14px #1c1e23 with -6px -6px 14px #3a3e48. Small raised is half that. Pressed is the same pair inset, used for the selected tile, current nav, search and fields.
    icons:
        18px line icons, blue when current. Chips on the well colour pair
        a filled star with Starred, two heads with Shared with 4 people
        and an up arrow ring with Uploading 62%, with a pressed 8px track.
    focus: A 3px solid blue outline with a 4px offset, never a shadow alone.
    tone: Friendly and short, such as Details, Get link and 64.2 GB of 100 GB used.
